    "solution": "If $n_1 = n$ and $n_2 = n + 1$ Maximum wavelength $\\lambda_{\\max} = \\frac{n^2(n+1)^2}{(2n+1)R}$\n\nTherefore, for large n, $\\lambda_{\\max} \\propto n^3$",
