    "difficulty": "medium",
    "status": "available",
    "solution": "$\\Delta E = h\\nu$\n$$\\nu = \\frac{\\Delta E}{h} = k\\left[\\frac{1}{(n-1)^2} - \\frac{1}{n^2}\\right] = \\frac{k(2n-1)}{n^2(n-1)^2}$$\n$$\\approx \\frac{2k}{n^3} \\propto \\frac{1}{n^3}$$",
