    "exam_type": "JEE",
    "question_type": "single",
    "question_text": "Both the nucleus and the atom of some element are in their respective first excited states. They get de-excited by emitting photons of wavelengths $\\lambda_N, \\lambda_A$ respectively. The ratio $\\frac{\\lambda_N}{\\lambda_A}$ is closest to:",
