    "solution": "From Rydberg's equation,\n$$\\frac{1}{\\lambda} = R \\left(\\frac{1}{n_1^2} - \\frac{1}{n_2^2}\\right)$$\n$$\\frac{1}{660 \\times 10^{-9}} = R \\left(\\frac{1}{2^2} - \\frac{1}{3^2}\\right)$$\n$$\\frac{1}{\\lambda} = R \\left(\\frac{1}{2^2} - \\frac{1}{4^2}\\right)$$\n$$\\frac{\\lambda}{660 \\times 10^{-9}} = \\frac{5}{9 \\times 4} \\times \\frac{16 \\times 4}{12}$$\n$$\\lambda = 488.9 nm$$",
