    "difficulty": "medium",
    "status": "available",
    "solution": "$$\\frac{1}{\\lambda_1} = R\\left[\\frac{1}{1^2} - \\frac{1}{4^2}\\right]$$\n$$\\frac{1}{\\lambda_2} = R\\left[\\frac{1}{3^2} - \\frac{1}{4^2}\\right]$$\n$$\\frac{\\lambda_1}{\\lambda_2} = \\frac{\\left[\\frac{1}{9} - \\frac{1}{16}\\right]}{\\left[1 - \\frac{1}{16}\\right]} = \\frac{7}{9 \\times 15}$$\n$$\\frac{\\lambda_1}{\\lambda_2} = \\frac{7}{135}$$",
