    "solution": "We know velocity of electron in $n^{\\text{th}}$ shell of hydrogen atom is given by\n\n$$v = \\frac{2\\pi k Z e^2}{nh}$$\n\n$$\\therefore v \\propto \\frac{1}{n}$$",
