    "status": "available",
    "solution": "$$F = -\\frac{dU}{dr} = -4U_0 r^3 = \\frac{mv^2}{r}$$\n\n$$mv^2 = 4U_0 r^4$$\n\n$$v \\propto r^2$$\n\n$$r^3 \\propto n$$\n\n$$\\Rightarrow r \\propto n^{1/3} \\Rightarrow \\alpha = 3$$",
