    "question_type": "single",
    "question_text": "A particular hydrogen like ion emits radiation of frequency $2.92 \\times 10^{15}\\text{ Hz}$ when it makes transition from $n = 3$ to $n = 1$. The frequency in $\\text{Hz}$ of radiation emitted in transition from $n = 2$ to $n = 1$ will be:",
