    "negative_marks": 1,
    "difficulty": "medium",
    "status": "available",
    "solution": "As we know,\n$$\\nu \\propto \\left[\\frac{1}{n_1^2} - \\frac{1}{n_2^2}\\right]$$\n\n$$\\frac{2.92 \\times 10^{15}}{\\nu} = \\frac{\\left[\\frac{1}{1} - \\frac{1}{9}\\right]}{\\left[\\frac{1}{1} - \\frac{1}{4}\\right]}$$\n\n$$\\nu = 2.92 \\times 10^{15} \\times \\frac{3}{4} \\times \\frac{9}{8}$$\n\n$$\\nu = 2.46 \\times 10^{15}\\text{ Hz}$$",
