    "question_type": "single",
    "question_text": "A free electron of $2.6 eV$ energy collides with a $H^+$ ion. This results in the formation of a hydrogen atom in the first excited state and a photon is released. Find the frequency of the emitted photon.\n($h = 6.6 \\times 10^{-34} J s$)",
