    "numeric_answer": null,
    "numerical_tolerance": 0,
    "marks": 4,
    "negative_marks": 1,
    "difficulty": "medium",
    "status": "available",
    "solution": "By Energy conservation\n$$(K.E.)_e = T.E._{H^+} + E_{Photon}$$\n$$2.6 = \\frac{-13.6}{4} + hf$$\n$$hf = 6 eV$$\n$$f = \\frac{6 \\times 1.6 \\times 10^{-19}}{6.626 \\times 10^{-34}}$$\n$$f = 1.45 \\times 10^{15} Hz = 1.45 \\times 10^9 MHz$$",
