    "solution": "The speed of electron is given by $v = 2.18 \times 10^6 \times \\frac{Z}{n} \\, ms^{-1}$, where, $Z$ is atomic number and $n$ is number of orbit.\n\nNow, for third orbit, ratio of speed of electron is $\\frac{v_H}{v_{He^+}} = \\frac{Z_H}{Z_{He^+}} = \\frac{1}{2}$\n\n$\\Rightarrow \\frac{v_{He^+}}{v_H} = \\frac{2}{1}$",
