    "difficulty": "medium",
    "status": "available",
    "solution": "Energy absorbed is given by,\n$$\\Delta E = 13.6 \\times \\left(\\frac{1}{n_1^2} - \\frac{1}{n_2^2}\\right)$$\n$$10.2 = 13.6 \\times \\left(\\frac{1}{n_1^2} - \\frac{1}{n_2^2}\\right)$$\n\nTherefore, we get, $n_1 = 1 \\& n_2 = 2$\n\nThe change in angular momentum\n$$\\Delta L = \\frac{n_2 h}{2\\pi} - \\frac{n_1 h}{2\\pi} = \\frac{h}{2\\pi}$$\n$$= 1.05 \\times 10^{-34} Js$$",
