    "question_text": "A beam of monochromatic light is used to excite the electron in $Li^{++}$ from the first orbit to the third orbit. The wavelength of monochromatic light is found to be $x \\times 10^{-10}m$. The value of $x$ is _____.\n\n[Given $hc = 1242eVnm$]",
