    "exam_type": "JEE",
    "question_type": "numerical",
    "question_text": "$\\sqrt{d_1}$ and $\\sqrt{d_2}$ are the impact parameters corresponding to scattering angles $60^\\circ$ and $90^\\circ$ respectively, when an $\\alpha$ particle is approaching a gold nucleus. For $d_1 = x d_2$, the value of $x$ will be _____.",
