    "correct_index": null,
    "correct_indices": [],
    "numeric_answer": 3,
    "numerical_tolerance": 0.05,
    "marks": 4,
    "negative_marks": 0,
    "difficulty": "medium",
    "status": "available",
    "solution": "The relation between impact parameter and scattering angle is $b = \\frac{k z e^2}{E} \\cot\\left(\\frac{\\theta}{2}\\right)$\n\n$\\Rightarrow b \\propto \\cot\\left(\\frac{\\theta}{2}\\right)$\n\n$\\Rightarrow \\sqrt{d_1} \\propto \\cot\\left(\\frac{60^\\circ}{2}\\right)$\n\n$\\Rightarrow \\sqrt{d_2} \\propto \\cot\\left(\\frac{90^\\circ}{2}\\right)$\n\n$\\frac{\\sqrt{d_1}}{\\sqrt{d_2}} = \\frac{\\cot\\left(\\frac{60^\\circ}{2}\\right)}{\\cot\\left(\\frac{90^\\circ}{2}\\right)} = \\sqrt{3} \\Rightarrow d_1 = 3d_2 \\Rightarrow x = 3$",
