    "exam_type": "JEE",
    "question_type": "single",
    "question_text": "The energy levels of an hydrogen atom are shown below. The transition corresponding to emission of shortest wavelength is\n\n[Image: Energy levels of a hydrogen atom showing levels $n=4, 3, 2, 1$ with transitions:\n- Transition $A$: from $n=4$ to $n=3$\n- Transition $B$: from $n=4$ to $n=2$\n- Transition $C$: from $n=3$ to $n=2$\n- Transition $D$: from $n=3$ to $n=1$]",
