    "exam_type": "JEE",
    "question_type": "numerical",
    "question_text": "When a hydrogen atom going from $n = 2$ to $n = 1$ emits a photon, its recoil speed is $\\frac{x}{5} \\text{ ms}^{-1}$. Where $x = \\underline{\\quad\\quad\\quad}$. (Use: mass of hydrogen atom $= 1.6 \\times 10^{-27} \\text{ kg}$, charge of electron $e = 1.6 \\times 10^{-19} \\text{ C}$)",
    "options": [],
