    "solution": "Moment of momentum is $\\vec{\\text{r}} \\times \\vec{\\text{P}}$ & $\\vec{\\text{L}} = \\vec{\\text{r}} \\times m\\vec{\\text{v}}$\n\n$$L = mvr = \\frac{nh}{2\\pi} = \\frac{4h}{2\\pi} = \\frac{2h}{\\pi}$$",
