    "question_text": "Radius of a certain orbit of hydrogen atom is $8.48\\text{ \\AA}$. If energy of electron in this orbit is $\\text{E / x}$, then $\\text{x} =$ _____ (Given $\\text{a}_0 = 0.529\\text{ \\AA}$, $E = \\text{energy of electron in ground state}$).",
    "options": [],
