    "solution": "We know $r = 0.529\\frac{n^2}{Z} \\Rightarrow 8.48 = 0.529\\frac{n^2}{1}$\n$n^2 = 16 \\Rightarrow n = 4$\nWe know $\\text{E} \\propto \\frac{1}{n^2}$\n$E_{n^{\\text{th}}} = \\frac{E}{16}$\n$x = 16$",
