    "question_text": "In an alpha particle scattering experiment distance of closest approach for the $\\alpha$ particle is $4.5 \\times 10^{-14}\\text{ m}$. If target nucleus has atomic number $80$, then maximum velocity of $\\alpha\\text{ - particle}$ is ______ $\\times 10^5\\text{ m/s}$ approximately.\n$$\\left(\\frac{1}{4\\pi\\epsilon_0} = 9 \\times 10^9\\text{ SI unit}, \\text{ mass of } \\alpha\\text{ particle} = 6.72 \\times 10^{-27}\\text{ kg}\\right)$$",
    "options": [],
